under</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">\"Impressive responsiveness and design consistency. The attention to detail is what makes this shine!\"</p>\n            </div>\n      \n            \n            <div className=\"bg-white shadow-md rounded-2xl p-6 max-w-sm flex flex-col items-start hover:shadow-xl transition\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-center mb-4\">\n                <img className=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=22\" alt=\"User avatar\" />\n                <div className=\"ml-4\">\n                  <h4 className=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">John</h4>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Frontend Developer</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">\"Clean layout, optimized for mobile, and extremely flexible with Tailwind. Loved using it!\"</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport { TailwindFlexComponentResponsiveTestimonialSectionUi }\n",
